{"claims":[{"excerpt":"Hoeveel energie was hernieuwbaar in 2024? Dat hangt af van wat je meet","claim":"There is no single 2024 renewable-energy share; the answer depends on which measure is used.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Laat zien waarom het antwoord verandert met wat je meet, aan de hand van de wereldcijfers voor 2024.","narrative":"De vraag welk deel van de energie wereldwijd hernieuwbaar is, heeft in 2024 niet één antwoord: het hangt af van wat je meet.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source evidence gives different shares for electricity production, total energy production, and total energy consumption, supporting the distinction in the title.","materiality":"This frames the article’s central comparison."},{"excerpt":"Wereldwijd kwam 32% van de elektriciteitsproductie in 2024 uit hernieuwbare bronnen.","claim":"Renewable sources accounted for 32% of global electricity production in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%.","narrative":"Hernieuwbare bronnen leverden 32% van de elektriciteit","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The supplied evidence reports the same 2024 production share and percentage.","materiality":"This is a central statistic; its production denominator is important."},{"excerpt":"hernieuwbare energie vormde 7% van zowel de totale energieproductie","claim":"Renewable energy accounted for 7% of total energy production in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%.","narrative":"hernieuwbare energie 7% uitmaakte van zowel de totale energieproductie","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The supplied evidence reports a 7% renewable share of all energy production.","materiality":"This is a central statistic and differs from the electricity-production share."},{"excerpt":"het totale energieverbruik.","claim":"Renewable energy accounted for 7% of total energy consumption in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"het totale energieverbruik","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The supplied evidence states that the renewable share of all energy consumption was 7%.","materiality":"This is a separate measure from energy production and electricity production."},{"excerpt":"Maar voor energie in bredere zin was het aandeel lager","claim":"The renewable share for energy in the broader sense was lower than the share for electricity production in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%. Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%. The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"terwijl hernieuwbare energie 7% uitmaakte van zowel de totale energieproductie als het totale energieverbruik","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The reported broader-energy shares (7%) are lower than the electricity-production share (32%).","materiality":"This comparison is central to the article’s main point."},{"excerpt":"Die percentages beschrijven verschillende afbakeningen. Het aandeel in de elektriciteitsproductie is dus niet hetzelfde als het aandeel in alle energieproductie of in het totale energieverbruik.","claim":"The electricity-production share and the shares for all energy production and consumption measure different scopes and are not interchangeable.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%. Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%. The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"De lezer moet begrijpen dat een percentage voor elektriciteit niet hetzelfde is als een percentage voor alle energie. Endpoint: Benadruk dat de percentages verschillende afbakeningen van energie beschrijven; noem daarom steeds waarop het aandeel betrekking heeft.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The evidence supplies distinct denominators and different resulting percentages; the text correctly cautions against treating them as the same measure.","materiality":"Confusing these scopes would materially misstate what the 32% represents."},{"excerpt":"De cijfers horen bij een gegevensversie van 1 juli 2026 en kunnen worden bijgewerkt.","claim":"The figures are associated with a July 1, 2026 data vintage and may be updated.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"This is a July 1, 2026 data vintage subject to change.","narrative":"De cijfers zijn voor 2024 en horen bij een gegevensversie van 1 juli 2026, die kan worden bijgewerkt.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The supplied evidence gives that vintage date and says the data are subject to change.","materiality":"The vintage and update caveat qualify the currency of the reported figures."}]}

